:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemies, see [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)]] and [[Black Thunder Rider (Enemy)]].''
'''Castle Horseman''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]] by completing the stage [[Running Through The Battlefield]] with a [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] of at least 4,500. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 4.6 gains more speed.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 250
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Castle Horseman
|name2 = Forest Horsemen Cavalry
|name3 = Black Thunder Rider
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Forest Horsemen Cavalry''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Black Thunder Rider''' when obtained from the [[Road to Horsemen Cavalry Evolution (Easy)|Road to Horsemen Cavalry Evolution]] stage and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat can be used as a rusher, similarly to how [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] is used, with the only difference being that you hope he dies quickly to protect your other Cats. Otherwise, the most use this Cat will help your army with is [[User Rank]], assuming you have nothing cheaper to invest in.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

